OL,3,ATrump calls Putin his 'friend' ahead of
OL,4,Atheir meeting with Xi in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump calls Vladimir Putin his
OL,7,F"friend" before they hold a meeting
OL,8,Fwith China's President Xi in Shenzhen
OL,10,FTrump held separate, bilateral meetings
OL,11,Fwith Putin and Xi before the three-way
OL,12,Ftalks
OL,14,FOne of Putin's aides said the bilateral
OL,15,Fmeeting with Trump went "well", with
OL,16,FPutin in an "excellent mood"
OL,18,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,19,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,20,Fwar
